{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id617412305"}, "name":{"label":"AnonPit"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-23T05:23:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"70.8"}, "id":{"label":"14701010430"}, "title":{"label":"They left him outside and then turned off the chat."}, "content":{"label":"I booked a hotel, the booking was confirmed, but upon arrival, the hotel owner demanded twice the amount. I wrote to Booking asking for help to sort out the situation, because I’m not ready to pay twice as much, and the daylight hours are ending, so I urgently need to find a hotel. Support told me to wait for a response within 24 hours; the next morning, I wrote again in the chat, but I didn’t get a response again, and in the evening they simply closed the chat, citing that there was no activity on my part. I sent photos of the hotel and the booking number in the chat. Basically, it’s just ignoring you and then closing the chat. If you book through this service, you might end up on the street, and they won’t care. Now I prefer to use more reliable and competent platforms. The bottom has been broken.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
